WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.291
Welcome to AroNexa. Here's a quick look at the doctor's side.

00:04.291 --> 00:14.491
Your home page shows today at a glance: patients, reports to explain, results pending and messages. Needs your attention picks out what to look at first.

00:14.491 --> 00:21.021
Press My calendar at the top of any page to see your bookings, block time, or mark a day as leave.

00:21.021 --> 00:30.624
Open a patient's record to see their vitals, problems and medicines. The body map shows records by organ, coloured by how each one is doing.

00:30.624 --> 00:42.232
In Scans and reports, compare an old scan with a new one, side by side or with the slider. Then press Explain to patient, to show it simply, in English or Malayalam.

00:42.232 --> 00:50.192
Documents sorts prescriptions, letters and certificates into folders. Just drag files onto the page to add more.

00:50.192 --> 00:56.317
When you prescribe, each medicine is checked against the patient's allergies and current medicines.

00:56.317 --> 01:02.037
Billing shows what's collected, pending and expected, with receipts and day reports.

01:02.037 --> 01:08.163
That's it. Your name at the top right lets you switch clinic or sign out. Now, start exploring.
